"2-NzQxNGM2YzMtMGM5Ni00ZDUxLTg5M2ItNmNiNzRhYWYyNTk4XzAxMA==","Laércio EXO Mindset Work Proposal","Florencia Daziano","https://www.linkedin.com/in/florencia-daziano","Laércio Germano","https://www.linkedin.com/in/laerciogermano","2022-07-12 14:45:40 UTC","Laércio EXO Mindset Work Proposal","Hi Laércio! My name is Florencia and I work for Exo Mindset, a Software Engineering Company located in Argentina with international projects. 
I saw in your profile that you have experience using Nodejs and Angular. We've got an opportunity strongly related to your career trajectory. 

Particulars are currently:
Full-stack language preference: Typescript
Front-end framework: Primarily Angular, some React, some Vue. Focus will probably shift from Angular in the near future.
Back-end: Microservices written in Typescript deployed as NodeJS AWS lambda functions.
Architecture: N-tier component-centric architecture, full IoC with DI.
Approach: Dev(Sec)Ops

- There are no dedicated specialists on the teams, instead all the engineers share responsibility for the full lifecycle of the application including design, architecture, development, testing, security, automation, deployment,
operations, monitoring, support etc.
- Specialists support the wider team on their objectives and help define the best practices and manage the quality of outcomes.

● Supporting tools: GitHub (source control, CI/CD, automation), Jira Software Cloud (agile project/product management), NPM (package management), Sentry (RUM), Hotjar (RUM), Grafana cloud (instrumentation, monitoring).

● Technologies
- Data/Persistence: AWS S3, AWS DynamoDB, AWS Aurora Serverless (PgSQL), AWS RDS (PgSQL), AWS Redshift
- Compute: AWS Lambda, AWS ECS Fargate, AWS ECS, AWS EC2, AWS Glue
- Networking: AWS CloudFront, AWS Route53, AWS DirectConnect, AWS WAF

● Guiding Stars:
- SOLID design principals
- DRY principal
- Abstractions should hide technology/implementation decision

We´re offering: 
• USD 5.000 and USD 7.000 (negotiable)

If you are interested in other technologies or your salary expectation is higher, please let me know, we have more than 150 open vacancies and I may have other opportunities to offer you.

FLORENCIA DAZIANO
