rage emerging technologies like AI and blockchain for strategic growth.&nbsp;</li><li>Lead cross-functional teams to drive enterprise-wide transformation.&nbsp;</li></ul><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><strong>Program Details:</strong>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Format: Online, designed for senior executives&nbsp;</li><li>Duration: 9-12 months&nbsp;</li><li>Fee: US$23,200 (Tuition fee benefit available for early applicants)&nbsp;</li><li>Eligibility: Minimum of 10 years of work experience&nbsp;</li><li>Networking: Optional in-person recognition ceremony at the University of Pennsylvania campus&nbsp;</li></ul><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><a rel=""noopener"" href=""https://online-execed.wharton.upenn.edu/chief-technology-officer-program?utm_source=Linkedin&utm_medium=MA&utm_campaign=B-365D_R-MEN_LI_MA_WH-CTO_JobTitle_CAPI&utm_content=MessageAdShortERIC&li_fat_id=09b9d601-aa31-4de2-82b3-edc6ca195fd6"" target=""_blank"">Download</a> the brochure today to explore the curriculum and admissions details.&nbsp;</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><br></p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">Best Regards,</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">Eric Hamberger</p>","ARCHIVE",""
