"2-YzMwZTQ4YTItZDM5MC00MDM5LThhZGEtMjhiYTg4M2M5YjliXzEwMA==","Sponsored Conversation","LinkedIn Member","","Laércio Germano","https://www.linkedin.com/in/laerciogermano","2026-09-24 22:29:15 UTC","","<p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">Hi %FIRSTNAME%,</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">​</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><br></p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">What if I told you that you could leverage your coding skills to help shape how AI learns – all from the comfort of your couch?​</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">​</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><br></p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">At DataAnnotation, we’re hiring coders like you to help improve AI code output.​</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><br></p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">✅ Starting at up to $100 an hour</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">✅ Fully remote​</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">✅ Work anytime you want​</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">✅ No AI experience required​</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><br></p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">Just bring your knowledge of Python, JavaScript, HTML, SQL, C++, or C#.​</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">​</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><br></p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">Curious? Apply below and help us build smarter AI.​</p>","ARCHIVE",""
