"2-MTlkMzNmOWEtZDJhYi00NjdkLWIyYTItYTgzNGJmZjVjMWQ2XzEwMA==","heads up: your agents are causing a traffic jam","Andy Ramirez","","Laércio Germano","https://www.linkedin.com/in/laerciogermano","2026-09-08 14:30:34 UTC","","<p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">Hey La&eacute;rcio,</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">AI coding tools are speeding up development. <strong>But what happens when all that AI-generated work hits code review, CI/CD, security, and release?</strong></p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><br></p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">That’s where a lot of teams are about to feel the pain.</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><br></p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">GitLab Transcend, a global livestream, on October 6 is focused on the part of agentic software engineering that comes after the code is written: how to keep the path to production moving fast, governed, and measurable.</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><br></p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">We’ll show what GitLab is building, what customers are learning, and how to ship at agent speed without creating chaos downstream.</p>","ARCHIVE",""
"2-OGZmMzg5ZDMtMjJkYS00YzQxLWExMGItYmIzMjIxN2RkZGM4XzEwMA==","can you prove AI is helping?","Stuart Moncada","","Laércio Germano","https://www.linkedin.com/in/laerciogermano","2026-09-01 00:14:30 UTC","","<p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">Hi La&eacute;rcio,</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><br></p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">You've probably got AI coding tools running across your teams by now. The harder question I keep hearing is whether it's creating real value, or just more activity.</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><br></p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">At GitLab Transcend, we're getting into how teams are actually measuring delivery gains, capacity, and blocked work as agentic engineering scales. I'd love for you to join.</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><br></p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break"">We're livestreaming globally on October 6, with live demos and lessons from teams further down this road than most.</p><p class=""spinmail-quill-editor__spin-break""><br></p>","ARCHIVE",""
